Subject: [PATCH] TrinityXSX: scan and launch Xbox Series games from a library

Scan game folders at startup and on refresh. Show Scarlett titles in a
controller-friendly window, select an entry, and run its manifest's executable
in the current Wine process. Preserve existing configs and seed offline PS5
settings on first launch. Provide a read-only command to inspect the catalog.

